OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain clearing to leave drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter conditions Monday. Mostly
OL,8,Fcloudy Tuesday, with brightest skies
OL,9,Fin the east. Band of rain moves
OL,10,Fsoutheast Wednesday. Warmer days, but
OL,11,Fchillier nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
